# Used INSTEAD of the root .dockerignore when building deploy/render/serve.Dockerfile (BuildKit
# reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). Everything is excluded except what the image COPYs.
*
!rust/fxradar-serve/Cargo.toml
!rust/fxradar-serve/Cargo.lock
!rust/fxradar-serve/src
!rust/fxradar-serve/static
!rust/fxradar-serve/benches
!rust/fxradar-serve/tests
!prompts
!docs/avatar_knowledge.md
!models/bundle_v1.4.0
!data
# local state that must never enter an image (gitignored anyway; belt and braces for local builds)
data/arcade.db
data/keys.db*
